            "notes": "Now we have enough cash for the core of our build and the main reason the playstyle works at all.\n\n# [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) and  [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) \n\nThese two items will be in your inventory for as long as possible as their value is incalculable.\n\nSpare cash can still go into  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)  as no Helix Rocket specific powers have been taken yet.",
